# judgement, §6) and does NOT auto-mutate cases — routing happens via EXISTING
# verbs (`error file`/`promote`, or adding a fingerprint to a `cites:` field per
# the §9 LINK RULE). ONE owner command + ONE approval gate (D-0050 rubric).
