# spec_edited tie. A host-config task's adoption proof is recorded by that seam at Stage-9 Closure —
# AFTER audit-post (the deferred-adoption family) — so events.jsonl (excluded from the diff, T-0219)
# is the ONLY place they appear. T-9621 added only the audit-post --host-config OVERLAY (prompt text
# telling the auditor "absence is expected"); surfacing them HERE makes the actual proof, when it
