# T-9513 (E-0034): the committed release-view/ paths land regenerates + folds, DERIVED from the SINGLE
# source `_release_view_docs()` (= CANONICAL_DOCS + graph/floor-trigger-map.md — no second file list,
# SPEC-0074 §2). Folded into BOTH land bookkeeping sets here (after RELEASE_VIEW_DIR + _release_view_docs
# are defined): _DERIVED_MERGE_ARTIFACTS so a concurrent-land conflict on a derived view file auto-resolves
