# T-0316 — `plan stage <NAME>`: the authoritative gated plan-lifecycle transition verb, mirroring
# `task stage` on ONE `status` field (no status/stage duality — §Stage model Decision 1). Per the
# accepted governing plan `plan-lifecycle-delivery-parity-redesign`. The per-stage side-effects are
# shared cores so `plan accept` / `plan close --resolution` / `plan reject` become NON-AUTHORITATIVE
# compatibility shims over the SAME logic (no parallel control surface, anti-cx F1).
